  "policy_id": "workunit_seed_conversion_policy_v0",
  "label": "WorkUnit seed conversion policy",
  "description": "Policy for drafting non-executable WorkUnit seed records from ObservationCandidates, review queue entries, and SearchNeed seed drafts without creating runtime work, accepted evidence, source approval, or master-index changes.",
